{"seq":2,"slug":"pipeline-orchestration","title":"流水线编排与调度","url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/mlops-platform/pipeline/pipeline-orchestration","wordCount":1099,"readingTime":5,"html":"<h1 id=\"流水线编排与调度\">流水线编排与调度</h1><p>ML 流水线不是跑一个 Python 脚本——它是一个多步骤、有依赖、可能跨天运行的 DAG（有向无环图），其中每个节点可能消耗不同的计算资源（CPU 预处理 → GPU 训练 → CPU 评估）。流水线编排系统负责把这些步骤可靠地连接起来，处理重试、并行、资源分配和失败恢复。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>ML 流水线编排的核心挑战是：<strong>如何让一个由异构计算步骤组成的 DAG 在分布式环境中可靠、高效地执行，同时保证可复现性。</strong></p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    A[数据拉取] --&gt; B[数据验证]&#10;    B --&gt; C[特征工程]&#10;    C --&gt; D[训练]&#10;    C --&gt; E[验证集准备]&#10;    D --&gt; F[模型评估]&#10;    E --&gt; F&#10;    F --&gt; G{通过阈值?}&#10;    G --&gt;|是| H[模型注册]&#10;    G --&gt;|否| I[告警 + 终止]&#10;    H --&gt; J[部署触发]\">graph TD\n    A[数据拉取] --&gt; B[数据验证]\n    B --&gt; C[特征工程]\n    C --&gt; D[训练]\n    C --&gt; E[验证集准备]\n    D --&gt; F[模型评估]\n    E --&gt; F\n    F --&gt; G{通过阈值?}\n    G --&gt;|是| H[模型注册]\n    G --&gt;|否| I[告警 + 终止]\n    H --&gt; J[部署触发]</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>编排概念</th>\n<th>含义</th>\n<th>示例</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>DAG</td>\n<td>步骤依赖关系图</td>\n<td>训练依赖预处理完成</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Step/Task</td>\n<td>一个原子执行单元</td>\n<td>&quot;训练 XGBoost 模型&quot;</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Artifact</td>\n<td>步骤间传递的数据/模型</td>\n<td>训练好的模型文件</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Trigger</td>\n<td>流水线启动条件</td>\n<td>cron 调度 / 数据到达 / API 调用</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Retry Policy</td>\n<td>失败重试策略</td>\n<td>指数退避重试 3 次</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Cache</td>\n<td>步骤结果缓存</td>\n<td>数据未变则跳过预处理</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"kubeflow-pipelines-深入\">Kubeflow Pipelines 深入</h2><p>Kubeflow Pipelines 是 Kubernetes 原生的 ML 编排方案。它的设计哲学是：<strong>每个步骤是一个容器，流水线是容器的 DAG</strong>。</p>\n<p><strong>架构组成：</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Pipeline DSL</strong>：Python SDK 定义 DAG 结构</li>\n<li><strong>Argo Workflows</strong>：底层执行引擎（Kubernetes CRD）</li>\n<li><strong>Metadata Store</strong>：元数据和产物追踪（ML Metadata）</li>\n<li><strong>UI</strong>：可视化流水线执行状态和血缘</li>\n</ul>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"python\" data-code=\"from kfp import dsl&#10;&#10;@dsl.component(base_image=&quot;python:3.11&quot;)&#10;def preprocess(data_path: str) -&gt; str:&#10;    # 数据预处理逻辑&#10;    return processed_path&#10;&#10;@dsl.component(base_image=&quot;pytorch/pytorch:2.3-cuda12.1&quot;)&#10;def train(data_path: str, lr: float) -&gt; str:&#10;    # 训练逻辑&#10;    return model_path&#10;&#10;@dsl.pipeline(name=&quot;fraud-detection-pipeline&quot;)&#10;def pipeline(data_path: str, lr: float = 0.001):&#10;    prep = preprocess(data_path=data_path)&#10;    model = train(data_path=prep.output, lr=lr)\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">from</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> kfp </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> dsl</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">@dsl.component</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">base_image</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"python:3.11\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">def</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> preprocess</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(data_path: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">str</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) -> </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">str</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">    # 数据预处理逻辑</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> processed_path</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">@dsl.component</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">base_image</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"pytorch/pytorch:2.3-cuda12.1\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">def</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> train</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(data_path: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">str</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, lr: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">float</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) -> </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">str</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">    # 训练逻辑</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> model_path</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">@dsl.pipeline</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">name</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"fraud-detection-pipeline\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">def</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> pipeline</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(data_path: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">str</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, lr: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">float</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0.001</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">):</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    prep </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> preprocess(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">data_path</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">data_path)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    model </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> train(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">data_path</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">prep.output, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">lr</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">lr)</span></span></code></pre></div><p><strong>Kubeflow 的优势与代价：</strong></p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>优势</th>\n<th>代价</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>Kubernetes 原生，天然支持 GPU 调度</td>\n<td>集群运维复杂度高</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>步骤容器化，完全隔离和可复现</td>\n<td>冷启动延迟（拉镜像）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>与 KServe 无缝集成 serving</td>\n<td>小团队上手门槛高</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>支持分布式训练（Training Operators）</td>\n<td>调试困难（需 kubectl）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Katib 内置超参调优</td>\n<td>本地开发体验差</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"zenml-开发者友好的替代\">ZenML：开发者友好的替代</h2><p>ZenML 定位为&quot;开发者友好的 MLOps 框架&quot;，其核心理念是<strong>解耦编排逻辑与执行基础设施</strong>——同一份流水线代码可以在本地、Airflow、Kubeflow、SageMaker 等不同后端上运行。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"python\" data-code=\"from zenml import pipeline, step&#10;&#10;@step&#10;def train_model(data: pd.DataFrame) -&gt; Model:&#10;    # 训练逻辑&#10;    return model&#10;&#10;@step&#10;def evaluate(model: Model) -&gt; float:&#10;    # 评估逻辑&#10;    return accuracy&#10;&#10;@pipeline&#10;def training_pipeline():&#10;    data = load_data()&#10;    model = train_model(data)&#10;    score = evaluate(model)\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">from</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> zenml </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> pipeline, step</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">@step</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">def</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> train_model</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(data: pd.DataFrame) -> Model:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">    # 训练逻辑</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> model</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">@step</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">def</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> evaluate</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(model: Model) -> </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">float</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">    # 评估逻辑</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> accuracy</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">@pipeline</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">def</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> training_pipeline</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">():</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    data </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> load_data()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    model </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> train_model(data)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    score </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> evaluate(model)</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"工具全景对比\">工具全景对比</h2><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>维度</th>\n<th>Kubeflow</th>\n<th>ZenML</th>\n<th>Airflow</th>\n<th>Prefect</th>\n<th>Flyte</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>定位</td>\n<td>K8s 原生 ML</td>\n<td>框架抽象层</td>\n<td>通用调度</td>\n<td>现代调度</td>\n<td>ML 原生编排</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>执行模式</td>\n<td>容器 DAG</td>\n<td>多后端适配</td>\n<td>Task DAG</td>\n<td>动态 Flow</td>\n<td>容器 + 缓存</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>GPU 支持</td>\n<td>原生</td>\n<td>通过后端</td>\n<td>需配置</td>\n<td>需配置</td>\n<td>原生</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>学习曲线</td>\n<td>陡峭</td>\n<td>平缓</td>\n<td>中等</td>\n<td>平缓</td>\n<td>中等</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>适用规模</td>\n<td>大型组织</td>\n<td>中小到大型</td>\n<td>全规模</td>\n<td>中小型</td>\n<td>中大型</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>2026 状态</td>\n<td>1.9 稳定</td>\n<td>0.70+ 活跃</td>\n<td>2.10 成熟</td>\n<td>3.x 成熟</td>\n<td>1.12 稳定</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"调度策略设计\">调度策略设计</h2><p>ML 流水线的调度比 Web 应用的 cron job 复杂得多——它需要考虑数据就绪性、资源争用和模型时效性的平衡。</p>\n<p><strong>三种调度模式：</strong></p>\n<ol>\n<li><strong>定时调度（Time-based）</strong>：固定周期（每日/每周）重跑流水线。简单但可能浪费资源——数据没变也跑。</li>\n<li><strong>数据驱动调度（Data-triggered）</strong>：新数据到达触发流水线。高效但需要数据到达检测机制。</li>\n<li><strong>性能驱动调度（Performance-triggered）</strong>：监控系统检测到模型性能衰退时触发重训练。最精准但依赖可靠的监控。</li>\n</ol>\n<p><strong>混合策略（2026 最佳实践）：</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>日常：数据驱动调度（数据到达 → 验证 → 训练）</li>\n<li>兜底：定时调度（每周强制全量重训练）</li>\n<li>紧急：性能驱动（漂移告警 → 立即重训练）</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"流水线缓存与增量计算\">流水线缓存与增量计算</h2><p>避免重复计算是大规模流水线的关键优化：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>步骤缓存</strong>：输入不变则直接使用上次输出（Kubeflow/Flyte 原生支持）</li>\n<li><strong>增量预处理</strong>：只处理新增数据，与历史特征合并</li>\n<li><strong>模型热启动</strong>：从上一版本检查点继续训练，而非从零开始</li>\n</ul>\n<p>缓存失效策略同样重要：代码变更、依赖更新、schema 变化都应触发缓存失效。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>ML 流水线是异构计算 DAG，编排系统管理依赖、资源和容错</li>\n<li>Kubeflow 适合 K8s 原生大规模环境，ZenML 适合需要多后端灵活性的团队</li>\n<li>调度策略混合使用：数据驱动 + 定时兜底 + 性能紧急</li>\n<li>缓存和增量计算是规模化的关键优化手段</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"延伸阅读\">延伸阅读</h2><ul>\n<li><a href=\"../mlops-model-deployment/pipeline/ci-cd-ml\">MLOps 模型部署：CI/CD for ML</a> — CI/CD 如何与流水线编排协同</li>\n<li><a href=\"../../ai-llm/ai-infrastructure-mlops/training-infrastructure/training-orchestration\">AI 基础设施：训练编排</a> — 分布式训练的编排细节</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"流水线编排与调度","id":"流水线编排与调度"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"Kubeflow Pipelines 深入","id":"kubeflow-pipelines-深入"},{"level":2,"text":"ZenML：开发者友好的替代","id":"zenml-开发者友好的替代"},{"level":2,"text":"工具全景对比","id":"工具全景对比"},{"level":2,"text":"调度策略设计","id":"调度策略设计"},{"level":2,"text":"流水线缓存与增量计算","id":"流水线缓存与增量计算"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"},{"level":2,"text":"延伸阅读","id":"延伸阅读"}],"prev":{"title":"实验追踪与 MLflow 3","url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/mlops-platform/pipeline/experiment-tracking-mlflow3"},"next":{"title":"ML 持续集成与交付","url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/mlops-platform/pipeline/ci-cd-for-ml"}}